{
  "$meta": {
    "name": "Relyra Design Tokens",
    "source": "Phase 58 Canonical Lock Set (brandbook/notes/decision-log.md)",
    "accessibility": "Every color value passes its WCAG 2.2 requirement per brandbook/notes/accessibility-checks.md. Remediated gold to #9A6B1C (text-capable 4.51:1) and dark border to #64748B (passes non-text 3:1); the original contrast-failing values are intentionally absent.",
    "notes": [
      "semantic.info equals semantic.action (Relay Blue #3454D1) by design (D-04); ALWAYS disambiguate info from a clickable action with an icon + label affordance, never by color alone.",
      "Soft Line #D8E0EA is a decorative divider only (D-03); interactive boundaries use Accessible Border #7E8A9A.",
      "One value per role; no near-duplicate neutrals (D-08)."
    ]
  },
